==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|вѣдь||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|вѣдѣ}}. Russian {{m|ru|ведь}} is a former {{der|ru|ine-pro|-}} root [[perfect tense|perfect]] {{m|ine-pro|*wóyde}} with [[mediopassive]] ending ''-ai'', with meaning "I have seen". Cognate with {{cog|en|wit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ведь.ogg}}

===Interjection===
{{head|ru|interjection}}

# [[after all]]
# [[indeed]], [[surely]]
# [[why]], [[well]]
# [[then]], you know, you see
# isn’t it?
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Ведь''' [[уже́]] [[по́здно]]|It’s late, isn’t it?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Ведь''' [[он]] [[знато́к]]|After all, he’s an expert.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Ведь''' [[я]] [[вы|вам]] [[говорить|говори́л]]!|But I told you!}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|ru|conjunction}}

# [[as]], [[because]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[он|Он]] [[лежать|лежи́т]], '''ведь''' [[на]] [[прошлый|про́шлой]] [[неделя|неде́ле]] [[он]] [[заболеть|заболе́л]]|He’s in bed, as last week he fell ill.}}

